implementation = "Merge bounded per-family reverse MVCC iterators in full-key order, preserving nil and prefix-only bounds, historical visibility, tombstones, iterator errors and resource ownership. Forward iteration copies that reverse snapshot and traverses it backward in increasing byte order in both storage configurations."
