attempt_4 = "The unchanged carried candidate failed four unified forward version-2 subtests of TestRepair_177_SeparateEVMIteratorRangeReopen; all assertions remain. EVM forward iteration now uses the correct reverse visibility path and releases all backend iterators before returning its copied snapshot; memory is proportional to the requested range. Add a live key after each future key within the same family and compare every returned value with Get; test early close and invalid access in both configurations."
gotcha = "A successful later test hides earlier subtest failures in the gate tail; inspect the whole retained log, whose four failures here occur at repair_177_test.go:188. Error must be read before closing backend cursors; the EVM adapter caches it and owns child cleanup."
qualification = "The bounded hf-build and hf-done ledger and final evidence line record the exact candidate revision, command, exit code and private log location."

